    h3 Loading
    text You can very easily turn a button into its loading version by appending the is-loading modifier. You don't even need to remove the inner text, which allows the button to maintain its original size between its default and loading states.
    row
      col
        row
          button Loading
          button Loading primary
          button Loading success
          button Loading primary
          button Loading success
          button Loading warning
          button Loading danger
        card
          text "Since the loading spinner is implemented using the ::after pseudo-element, it is not supported by the <input type=\"submit\"> element. Consider using <button type=\"submit\"> instead." primary
      col
        text "<button class=\"button is-loading\">Loading</button> <button class=\"button is-link is-loading\">Loading</button> <button class=\"button is-primary is-loading\">Loading</button> <button class=\"button is-info is-loading\">Loading</button> <button class=\"button is-success is-loading\">Loading</button> <button class=\"button is-warning is-loading\">Loading</button> <button class=\"button is-danger is-loading\">Loading</button>"
        button Copy success
